            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.29.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Matl 29:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 15:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa takweensi kwaabila basinzala cilyo cako, kunjizya bapengede batandidwe muŋanda yako, kusamika simudukwa nomubona, akutayuba kumeso aabantunyokwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumuni wako unoemunika mbuli bucedo, nkabela uyoofwambaana kuponezegwa. Bululami bwako buyookusololela, abulemu bwa-Jehova buyookusindikila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyooita, nkabela Jehova uyoovuwa; wakwiila buyo, uyooamba kuti, Mpendi. Na wagwisya majokwe aali akati kanu, na waleka kutondesya munwe akwaamba bubi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.11.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 11:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na waabila basinzala zilyo zyako akukutya myoyo yabapengede, lino uyoocedwa mumuni mukati kamudima, aciindi cisia mbi ciyoosanduka kuba mbuli isikati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jehova uyookweenzya lyoonse, akukatalusya moyo wako mumasena mayumu. Uyooabila zifuwa zyako inguzu, nkabela uyooba mbuli muunda uutuntulilwa, ambuli butoolo bwamaanzi buli amaanzi aatayuminini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bana bako bayooyakulula matongo aaciindi; uyoobukulusya intalisyo zyamazyalani aakamana; nkabela uyootegwa kuti sikumama myaatuko, sikubukulusya meendelo aamakalilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 19:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.56.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 56:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 12:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakasya maulu aako kusofwaazya Sabata, na waleka kucita ncoyanda omwini buyo mubuzuba bwangu busalala, na buzuba bwa-Sabata mbuyandisi mumeso aako, alimwi buzuba busalala bwa-Jehova mbulemu, na wabulemeka kukutatola inzila zyako omwini nikuba kulibotezya buyo nikuba kwaamba majwi aabuyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
