                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lino unoolijanina busekelezi muli-Jehova, nkabela njookutansika amasena aasumpwidwe aanyika akukulisya caabilo causo Jakobo, nkaambo mbuboobo mbuuamba mulomo wa-Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
